_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116497","id":4499575663,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDDITbw","user":{"login":"MiTaigo","id":44925752,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0OTI1NzUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44925752?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MiTaigo","html_url":"https://github.com/MiTaigo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MiTaigo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MiTaigo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MiTaigo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MiTaigo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MiTaigo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MiTaigo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MiTaigo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MiTaigo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MiTaigo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-20T14:47:53Z","updated_at":"2026-05-24T19:17:36Z","body":"I noticed that these errors occur when frequently changing a large number of variables in the inspector. I had an array of many objects, and these objects also had a list inside. And when all of this was being updated almost every frame, these errors started to appear. When I removed this large array from the inspector — i.e., removed '@export' — the errors stopped appearing.\n\nupdate: \nAfter a couple more experiments, I also found that if I simply avoid looking at the Inspector — where those large data sets are being updated — the errors don't occur either. I suspect the debugger just can't handle that much data… maybe. I'm not really sure.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4499575663/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart"